OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start in the east,
OL,6,Fwhile the west is generally cloudier
OL,7,Fwith patchy light rain. Cloud will
OL,8,Fbecome more widespread through the
OL,9,Fday, bringing the chance of a light
OL,10,Fshower almost anywhere. Despite this,
OL,11,Fit will remain warm.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRather cloudy and mainly dry
OL,14,Fthis evening, though one or two
OL,15,Fshowers may break out later overnight.
OL,16,FA band of rain will arrive around
OL,17,Fdawn, heaviest in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
