OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FRain, heavy and briefly
OL,6,Faccompanied by strong winds, moving
OL,7,Feast to brighter skies and a few
OL,8,Fshowers in the afternoon. Turning
OL,9,Fnotably chilly in the evening, with
OL,10,Fclearing skies.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FFine
OL,13,Fand sunny on Thursday after a chilly
OL,14,Fstart. Breezy with a few outbreaks of
OL,15,Frain Friday. Chilly with early fog
OL,16,Fpatches on Saturday, giving way to
OL,17,Fsunny spells later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
